## 数组排序

### 1. 基础排序函数

```php
$numbers = [5, 2, 8, 1, 9];

// 升序排序（索引重新排序）
sort($numbers);  // [1, 2, 5, 8, 9]

// 降序排序
rsort($numbers);  // [9, 8, 5, 2, 1]

// 升序排序（保持索引关联）
asort($numbers);

// 降序排序（保持索引关联）
arsort($numbers);
```

### 2. 关键数组排序

```php
$person = ["name" => "张三", "age" => 25, "city" => "北京"];

// 按键升序排序
ksort($person);

// 按键降序排序
krsort($person);
```

### 3. 自定义排序

```php
// 用户定义的比较函数
$users = [
    ["name" => "张三", "age" => 25],
    ["name" => "李四", "age" => 20],
    ["name" => "王五", "age" => 30]
];

// 按年龄排序
usort($users, function($a, $b) {
    return $a["age"] - $b["age"];
});

// 保持键关联的自定义排序
uasort($users, function($a, $b) {
    return strcmp($a["name"], $b["name"]);
});
```

### 4. 多维数组排序

```php
$students = [
    ["name" => "张三", "score" => 85, "class" => "A"],
    ["name" => "李四", "score" => 92, "class" => "B"],
    ["name" => "王五", "score" => 78, "class" => "A"]
];

// 按分数排序
array_multisort(
    array_column($students, "score"),
    SORT_DESC,
    $students
);

// 多条件排序
array_multisort(
    array_column($students, "class"), SORT_ASC,
    array_column($students, "score"), SORT_DESC,
    $students
);
```

### 5. 随机排序

```php
