<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<title>实时股票价格监控</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<h1>实时股票价格</h1>
		<div id="stock-price"></div>

		<script>
			const eventSource = new EventSource("/stock-price");
			eventSource.onmessage = function (event) {
				document.getElementById("stock-price").innerHTML = event.data;
			};
		</script>
	</body></html
>
```

